#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to do common tasks, from install and authentication to checking job status and fetching error messages"
msgstr "Paano gawin ang mga karaniwang gawain, mula sa pag-install at authentication hanggang sa pagtsek ng status ng job at pagkuha ng mga error message"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with Qiskit Functions"
msgstr "Magsimula sa Qiskit Functions"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/functions-get-started.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Jarman, HIVQE, Cadavid, Chandarana, Leclerc, Sachdeva, HUBO, Filippov, Downfolding, Aharonov, Mundada, Yamauchi, supersymmetric, Paterakis, Gharibyan, Jaffali, Pellow */}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium, Flex, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users can get started with IBM Qiskit Functions for free, or can procure a license from one of the partners who have contributed a function to the catalog.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga gumagamit ng Premium, Flex, at On-Prem (sa pamamagitan ng IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan ay maaaring magsimula sa IBM Qiskit Functions nang libre, o maaaring kumuha ng lisensya mula sa isa sa mga partner na nag-ambag ng function sa catalog.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request a free trial for third-party Qiskit Functions {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"
msgstr "Humiling ng libreng trial para sa third-party na Qiskit Functions {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To request a free trial, navigate to the [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), and explore the details panel. Click `Request a free trial` and fill out information required by the Functions partner, including the IBM Cloud `AccessGroupId`:\n"
msgstr "Upang humiling ng libreng trial, pumunta sa [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), at galugarin ang details panel. I-click ang `Request a free trial` at punan ang impormasyong kinakailangan ng Functions partner, kabilang ang IBM Cloud `AccessGroupId`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"
msgstr "Pumunta sa [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify eligibility.\n"
msgstr "Tiyakin ang eligibility.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch your account in the menu bar on the header to one with the following format: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"
msgstr "I-switch ang iyong account sa menu bar sa header patungo sa isa na may sumusunod na format: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure the organization is the same as the one associated with your Premium account.\n"
msgstr "Tiyakin na ang organisasyon ay pareho sa nauugnay sa iyong Premium account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you see \"[Your Name]'s Account\", you are using your _personal_ account, which is not eligible for premium access.\n"
msgstr "Kung makita mo ang \"[Your Name]'s Account\", ginagamit mo ang iyong _personal_ na account, na hindi eligible para sa premium access.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access group ID.\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang iyong access group ID.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click a group name.\n"
msgstr "I-click ang isang group name.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Details**.\n"
msgstr "I-click ang **Details**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy the access group ID. It should start with `AccessGroup-`.\n"
msgstr "Kopyahin ang access group ID. Dapat itong magsimula sa `AccessGroup-`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Functions Catalog client {#install-the-qiskit-functions-catalog-client}"
msgstr "I-install ang Qiskit Functions Catalog client {#install-the-qiskit-functions-catalog-client}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To start using Qiskit Functions, install the IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog client:\n"
msgstr "Upang magsimulang gamitin ang Qiskit Functions, i-install ang IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog client:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve your API key from the [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and activate your Python virtual environment.  See the [installation instructions](/guides/install-qiskit#local) if you do not already have a virtual environment set up.\n"
msgstr "Kunin ang iyong API key mula sa [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), at i-activate ang iyong Python virtual environment.  Tingnan ang [installation instructions](/guides/install-qiskit#local) kung wala ka pang naka-set up na virtual environment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <span id=\"save-account\"></span>**If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation),** use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally. ([Skip to the next step](#functions-untrusted) if you are not using a trusted environment, such as a shared or public computer, to authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform.)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   To use `save_account()`, run `python` in your shell, then enter the following:\n"
msgstr "   Upang gamitin ang `save_account()`, patakbuhin ang `python` sa iyong shell, pagkatapos ay ilagay ang sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Type `exit()`. From now on, whenever you need to authenticate to the service, you can load your credentials with the following:\n"
msgstr "   I-type ang `exit()`. Mula ngayon, sa tuwing kailangan mong mag-authenticate sa serbisyo, maaari mong i-load ang iyong mga credential gamit ang sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   For example:\n"
msgstr "   Halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Avoid executing code on an untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example, a public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic. To initialize the service in this situation, use this code:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"**Never include your key in source code, Python scripts, or notebook files.** When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the key and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protektahan ang iyong API key\">\n"
"**Huwag kailanman isama ang iyong key sa source code, Python scripts, o notebook files.** Kapag nagbabahagi ng code sa iba, tiyakin na hindi naka-embed ang iyong API key nang direkta sa Python script. Sa halip, ibahagi ang script nang walang key at magbigay ng mga tagubilin para sa ligtas na pag-set up nito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung aksidenteng naibahagi mo ang iyong key sa iba o naisama ito sa version control tulad ng Git, agad na i-revoke ang iyong key sa pamamagitan ng pagtanggal nito sa [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page upang mabawasan ang panganib. Alamin pa sa [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List the functions you can access {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"
msgstr "Ilista ang mga function na maaari mong ma-access {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you authenticate, you can list the functions from the Qiskit Functions Catalog that you have access to:\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos mong mag-authenticate, maaari mong ilista ang mga function mula sa Qiskit Functions Catalog na maaari mong ma-access:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run enabled functions {#run-enabled-functions}"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang mga naka-enable na function {#run-enabled-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a catalog object has been instantiated, you can select a function by using `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"
msgstr "Matapos ma-instantiate ang isang catalog object, maaari kang pumili ng function gamit ang `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each Qiskit Function has custom inputs, options, and outputs. Check the specific documentation pages for the function you want to run for more information. By default, all users can only run one function job at a time:\n"
msgstr "Ang bawat Qiskit Function ay may custom na inputs, options, at outputs. Tingnan ang partikular na mga documentation page para sa function na gusto mong patakbuhin para sa karagdagang impormasyon. Bilang default, maaari lamang magpatakbo ang lahat ng gumagamit ng isang function job sa isang pagkakataon:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`run()` checks your remaining capacity and backend access before it submits the job. If your instance is out of capacity, or the backend you named is not accessible, `run()` raises an error right away instead of leaving the job to fail in the queue. When capacity is low, `run()` emits a warning. Pass `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` to silence it.\n"
msgstr "Tinitsek ng `run()` ang natitira mong capacity at backend access bago i-submit ang job. Kung wala nang capacity ang iyong instance, o hindi ma-access ang backend na pinangalanan mo, agad na magpapataas ang `run()` ng error sa halip na hayaang mabigo ang job sa queue. Kapag mababa ang capacity, maglalabas ang `run()` ng warning. Ipasa ang `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` upang patahimikin ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"check-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Tsekin ang status ng job {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With your Qiskit Function `job_id`, you can check the status of running jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Gamit ang iyong Qiskit Function na `job_id`, maaari mong tsekin ang status ng mga tumatakbong job. Kasama dito ang sumusunod na mga status:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Function queue. The queue priority is based on how much you've used Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "**`QUEUED`**: Nasa queue ng Qiskit Function ang remote program. Ang priyoridad sa queue ay nakabatay sa kung gaano mo nagamit ang Qiskit Functions.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up the remote environment and installing dependencies.\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: Nagsisimula ang remote program; kasama dito ang pag-set up ng remote environment at pag-install ng mga dependency.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. This also includes several more detailed statuses if supported by specific functions.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: Tumatakbo ang programa. Kasama rin dito ang ilang mas detalyadong status kung sinusuportahan ng mga partikular na function.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: The function is currently mapping your classical inputs to quantum inputs.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: Kasalukuyang ino-mapa ng function ang iyong classical inputs patungo sa quantum inputs.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: The function is optimizing for the selected QPU. This could include circuit transpilation, QPU characterization, observable backpropagation, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: Ino-optimize ng function para sa napiling QPU. Maaaring kabilang dito ang circuit transpilation, QPU characterization, observable backpropagation, at iba pa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: The function has submitted a job to IBM Quantum Compute Service, and is waiting in the queue.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: Nag-submit na ng job ang function sa IBM Quantum Compute Service, at naghihintay sa queue.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: The function has an active Quantum Compute job.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: May aktibong Quantum Compute job ang function.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: The function is post-processing results, which can include error mitigation, mapping quantum results to classical, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: Nagpo-post-process ng mga resulta ang function, na maaaring kabilang ang error mitigation, pag-mapa ng quantum results patungo sa classical, at iba pa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve result data with `job.result()`.\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: Kumpleto na ang programa, at maaari mong kunin ang result data gamit ang `job.result()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`ERROR`**: The program stopped running because of a problem. Use `job.result()` to get the error message.\n"
msgstr "**`ERROR`**: Huminto sa pagtakbo ang programa dahil sa isang problema. Gamitin ang `job.result()` upang makuha ang error message.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`CANCELED`**: The program was canceled by a user, the service, or the server.\n"
msgstr "**`CANCELED`**: Kinansela ang programa ng isang gumagamit, ng serbisyo, o ng server.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"retrieve-results\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results {#retrieve-results}"
msgstr "Kunin ang mga resulta {#retrieve-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.result()` to fetch the result. This output format varies with each function, so be sure to follow the specific documentation:\n"
msgstr "Matapos maging `DONE` ang isang programa, maaari mong gamitin ang `job.result()` upang kunin ang resulta. Nag-iiba ang output format na ito sa bawat function, kaya siguraduhing sundan ang partikular na dokumentasyon:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also cancel a job at any time:\n"
msgstr "Maaari mo ring kanselahin ang isang job anumang oras:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access the associated Quantum Compute jobs {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"
msgstr "I-access ang mga kaugnay na Quantum Compute job {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Qiskit Function can submit one or more Quantum Compute jobs to a QPU while it runs. To retrieve the IDs of those runtime jobs, use `job.runtime_jobs()`. You can use these IDs to fetch the runtime job objects from a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance, or to find the workloads on the IBM Quantum&reg; Platform dashboard.\n"
msgstr "Maaaring mag-submit ang isang Qiskit Function ng isa o higit pang Quantum Compute job sa isang QPU habang ito ay tumatakbo. Upang kunin ang mga ID ng mga runtime job na iyon, gamitin ang `job.runtime_jobs()`. Maaari mong gamitin ang mga ID na ito upang kunin ang mga runtime job object mula sa isang `QiskitRuntimeService` instance, o upang hanapin ang mga workload sa IBM Quantum&reg; Platform dashboard.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a function groups its runtime jobs into sessions or batches, use `job.runtime_sessions()` to list the session IDs. Pass one session ID to `job.runtime_jobs()` to return only the runtime jobs in that session:\n"
msgstr "Kung pinagsasama-sama ng isang function ang mga runtime job nito sa mga session o batch, gamitin ang `job.runtime_sessions()` upang ilista ang mga session ID. Ipasa ang isang session ID sa `job.runtime_jobs()` upang ibalik lamang ang mga runtime job sa session na iyon:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The returned list can be empty. A function reports its runtime jobs only when it submits them through the runtime service that the function receives at run time, and some functions do not submit runtime jobs directly.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View job logs {#view-job-logs}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang mga log ng job {#view-job-logs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `job.logs()` to retrieve the log output that a function produces while it runs. Logs are useful for tracking progress and for debugging a job that ends in an `ERROR` state.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang `job.logs()` upang kunin ang log output na ginagawa ng isang function habang ito ay tumatakbo. Kapaki-pakinabang ang mga log para sa pagsubaybay ng progreso at pag-debug ng job na nagtatapos sa `ERROR` state.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a long-running job that produces many log lines, use `job.filtered_logs()` to return only the lines you want. Pass a regular expression to `include` to keep matching lines, or to `exclude` to drop matching lines:\n"
msgstr "Para sa mahabang tumatakbong job na gumagawa ng maraming log line, gamitin ang `job.filtered_logs()` upang ibalik lamang ang mga linyang gusto mo. Ipasa ang isang regular expression sa `include` upang panatilihin ang mga tumutugmang linya, o sa `exclude` upang tanggalin ang mga tumutugmang linya:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List previously run Qiskit Functions jobs {#list-previously-run-qiskit-functions-jobs}"
msgstr "Ilista ang mga naunang tumakbong Qiskit Functions job {#list-previously-run-qiskit-functions-jobs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Functions:\n"
msgstr "Maaari mong gamitin ang `jobs()` upang ilista ang lahat ng job na na-submit sa Qiskit Functions:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To narrow the results, pass filters. Filter by function with `function`, by status with `status`, and by submission date with `created_after`. Page through results with `limit` and `offset`:\n"
msgstr "Upang paliitin ang mga resulta, magpasa ng mga filter. Mag-filter ayon sa function gamit ang `function`, ayon sa status gamit ang `status`, at ayon sa petsa ng pag-submit gamit ang `created_after`. Mag-page-through ng mga resulta gamit ang `limit` at `offset`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you already have the job ID for a certain job, you can retrieve the job with `catalog.job()`:\n"
msgstr "Kung mayroon ka nang job ID para sa isang partikular na job, maaari mong kunin ang job gamit ang `catalog.job()`:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Kunin ang mga error message {#fetch-error-messages}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a program status is `ERROR`, use `job.error_message()` to fetch the error message as follows:\n"
msgstr "Kung ang status ng isang programa ay `ERROR`, gamitin ang `job.error_message()` upang kunin ang error message tulad ng sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Explore circuit functions](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) to build new algorithms and applications, without needing to manage transpilation or error handling.\n"
msgstr "[Explore circuit functions](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) upang bumuo ng mga bagong algorithm at aplikasyon, nang hindi kinakailangang pamahalaan ang transpilation o error handling.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Explore application functions](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) to solve domain-specific tasks, with classical inputs and outputs.\n"
msgstr "[Explore application functions](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) upang lutasin ang mga domain-specific na gawain, na may classical inputs at outputs.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) for Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "Tingnan ang [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) para sa Qiskit Functions.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- For hands-on experience, try out some [tutorials](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) that demonstrate Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Para sa hands-on na karanasan, subukan ang ilang [tutorials](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) na nagpapakita ng Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
